MODULE: ReaderEventuallyAnswersPureRetry
TARGET: ReaderEventuallyAnswers
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: Retry exhaustion starts another optimistic read instead of a bounded gate.
PERTURBS: ReaderOpportunity
--- FIND
    /\ (Capture \/ Acquire \/ ReadLeaf \/ Validate \/ ReaderIdle)
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: repeat optimistic reads indefinitely under sustained writers.
    /\ (Capture \/ Acquire \/ ReadLeaf \/ ReaderIdle
        \/ (reader = "validate" /\ reader' = (IF crossed THEN "capture" ELSE "done")
            /\ held' = FALSE /\ leaseLeft' = 0
            /\ UNCHANGED <<snapshot, observed, attempts, crossed>>))
--- END
